                <pb facs="0453" n="444" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg444"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2631/277: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Chile</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Frost</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-29T11:00:00-05:00">March 29, 1938—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. Your telegrams 34, 35 and 36, March 21, 22, and 24. The Department is
                    considering the Chilean exchange proposal. For your own information, the
                    proposal does not at first glance appear acceptable, but a definite and detailed
                    reply will be sent you in a few days after receipt of your air mail despatch
                        930.<anchor n="36" xml:id="d456-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
